@baseUrl = http://localhost:5188
@accept = application/json

### ========================================
### Segments
### ========================================

### Get all catalog segments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/segments?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### Get categories by segment (root categories with hierarchy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/segments/1/categories?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### ========================================
### Categories
### ========================================

### Get all root level categories (with hierarchy and segment info)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### Get category by ID (with full hierarchy and segment info)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### Get products by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/3/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### ========================================
### Products
### ========================================

###

### Get product with many parameters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### Get related products for a product (based on shared categories)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/related?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### ========================================
### Recommendations (GDS similarity + Spark co-purchase lift)
### ========================================
# strategy=content    -> SIMILAR_TO only (GDS FastRP + kNN). Run deploy/scripts/compute-similarity-embeddings.cypher first.
# strategy=behavioral -> ALSO_BOUGHT only (Spark lift). Run the spark/ pipeline first, see spark/README.md.
# strategy=hybrid      -> blends both, weighted (default when strategy is omitted).

### Get recommendations for a product (default strategy: hybrid)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recommendations?productId=1&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### Get recommendations for product 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recommendations?productId=2&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### Get recommendations page 2 (for large result sets)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recommendations?productId=1&page=2&pageSize=10
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### Content-based only (GDS similarity score)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recommendations?productId=1&page=1&pageSize=10&strategy=content
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### Behavioral only (Spark co-purchase lift)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recommendations?productId=1&page=1&pageSize=10&strategy=behavioral
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### Hybrid (blended, explicit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recommendations?productId=1&page=1&pageSize=10&strategy=hybrid
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### Invalid strategy -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recommendations?productId=1&page=1&pageSize=10&strategy=bogus
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### ========================================
### Search (Global autocomplete)
### ========================================

### Search for products, categories, and brands
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=phone&limit=5
Accept: {{accept}}

###

### Search with different term
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=sport&limit=10
Accept: {{accept}}

###
